"6\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,6)\">Deut 33:6</ref> <highlight>and (but) let his men be few.</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>בִּמְתֵי מְעָ֑ט</bdbheb> = <highlight>consisting of a few men</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 26:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,5)\">Deut 26:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:62\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"62\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"62\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,62)\">Deut 28:62</ref> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> elsewhere only in poetry, sex usually not emphasized: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Job 11:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,11,3)\">Job 11:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 24:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,12)\">Job 24:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 17:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,14)\">Ps 17:14</ref> (twice in verse) (but text probably corrupt, of. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup>; at least omit <bdbheb>ממתים ידך</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ol')\">Ol</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bi')\">Bi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hup')\">Hup-Now</lookup>); <bdbheb>מְתֵי ישׂראל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,14)\">Isa 41:14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> poetic phrase: <bdbheb>מְתֵי שָׁוְא</bdbheb> <highlight>men of false-hood</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 11:11\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(18,11,11)\">Job 11:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 26:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,26,4)\">Ps 26:4</ref> <bdbheb>אָוֶן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 22:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=